    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.poster.avif?t=1749341515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.webm?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.mp4?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.poster.avif?t=1749341515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.webm?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.mp4?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.poster.avif?t=1749341515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.webm?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.mp4?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find trinkets and trade them for unique shells, both real and fantastical!\u00a0<strong>Be the isopod that you want to be!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.poster.avif?t=1749341515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.webm?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.mp4?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.poster.avif?t=1749341515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.webm?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.mp4?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.poster.avif?t=1749341515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.webm?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.mp4?t=1749341515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find trinkets and trade them for unique shells, both real and fantastical!\u00a0<strong>Be the isopod that you want to be!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "You're a tiny pill-bug in a big world! Roll, zip, and slam your way through the gorgeous landscapes of the Australian bush, unite your fellow bugs, and fight back the greedy Fire Ant Conglomerate!",
